  "description": "Mina and Soyeon have been inseparable friends since childhood.\n\nOne day, they discover by chance that their boyfriends look exactly alike. Suspecting them of cheating, the two women lure their boyfriends to a hotel to get revenge.\n\nBut when they arrive, the two men are waiting for them at the hotel.\n\nIt turns out their boyfriends are twin brothers.\n\nJust as the misunderstanding is cleared up, the two women seize this unexpected coincidence as an opportunity to propose a secret relationship involving each other's partners...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/switchboyfriend), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/switch_bf)",
